> Is there any way of writing blessed enchant armor without
>any holy water? Bloody elven helms were ALL +0.

No. But just get holy water. Once you get protection from the Minetown
priest, they are of virtually no use. So whip out MM or fire and blast
away. Or be more humane and let your pet take the priest(ess) out. Keep
casting heals on your pet. You also have a stethoscope so you can check
health.

There's only one altar in the whole dungeon. You need it. Convert it and
do it as soon as you've purchased all the protection you can afford. Then
recover the money and use it to buy more protection from the priest of
Moloch in the VoTD.

